   <!-- Project Overview -->

            <div class="project-details">
                <h3 class="details-title">Project Overview</h3>
                <p class="details-text">Softwear was my classmates and my E-Commerce web application from my Software Engineering class at UTSA. I was assigned
            the database administrator role for this project. I designed the database schema, created the ERD diagram, and implemented the database using MySQL.
            I also helped out with the back-end developers getting everything connected through Spring Boot.</p>
            <p class="details-text">
                    Built as a team project for UTSA's Software Engineering course, this application demonstrates 
                    professional development practices including agile methodology, version control with Git, 
                    code reviews, and comprehensive testing.
                </p>
            </div>



